      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Funny, I was about to ask the exact same thing. A few of my avatars rely on the stencils in Xiexe's Toon Shader, but they end up just falling apart completely for any user with safety on. As a result they end up A. looking awful, as they're meant to be toon shaded, and B. completely broken, as parts that should be masked are now always visible. When I started using the shader, I was thinking it'd be one of the fallbacks. Why suggest a shader that will only be visible to a select few users?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
